<title>BERMUDA: Sky Games says B/E accepts stock for debt.</title>
<headline>Sky Games says B/E accepts stock for debt.</headline>
<dateline>HAMILTON, Bermuda 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sky Games International Inc on Monday said it had reached an agreement with B/E Aerospace Inc for the equity conversion of its debt to B/E.</p>
<p>Under the pact, the outstanding principal and accrued interest payable under a note to B/E as of February 28 would be converted into covertible preferred stock of Sky Games.</p>
</text>
